Z||000036||Galen||05-15-2001||01:03 AM||||I dunno, I say we all share a few flowers, and hug and all be happy. SBC's are cool, N*'s are cool.. Its all a matter of personal preferance. I personally wouldn't hae either. I like my lil 2.5. I dont care how many times I get stomped. I dont let it bother me cuz  I dont really care <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I like my car, I like the way it looks.. and thats all that matters. Its reliable, looks good, and is mine. why should I care what anyone else  thinks?<P>------------------<BR>Galen - 1988 Hawaiian Orchid Coupe Auto 4Banger - <A HREF="http://myfiero.spinrpg.com/" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero Website</A><BR>AIM: WookieeNC||||reg||1
